# THE MACHINES WILL NOT FOLLOW (docs/HUSH.md H1): hunted out on the crags, the
# player goes back into a ring and the machines stop at its edge, facing in,
# and hold there. From above: bodies stopped on a circle; over the shoulder,
# their optics on you through the stones.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/hush_hold.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
place the_crags
coast calm
near hush_ring
mark ring
walk 1,0 1.4 run
spawn runner
spawn runner
await noticed 10
at mark:ring
wait 4.0
shot 01-held-at-the-edge-from-above with mob:runner
# Turned to them (a touch of the keys; still well inside the stones).
walkto mob 0.15
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 02-held-at-the-edge-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
